<section class="section about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6 about-image"> <img src="freightimg/about/goodhope-freight.jpg" alt="Chinese logistics" class="img-fluid">
        <div class="experience-badge"> <span class="years">10+</span> <span class="label">Years Experience</span> </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 about-content"> <span class="section-badge"><svg class="icon-svg fa-info-circle" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM216 336h24V272H216c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24h48c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v88h8c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H216c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24zm40-208a32 32 0 1 1 0 64 32 32 0 1 1 0-64z"/></svg> ABOUT US</span>
        <h2>About GoodHope Freight Forwarder</h2>
        <p class="lead">Reliable Shipping Partner</p>
        <p>GoodHope Freight Forwarding is a rapidly growing international logistics provider based in Shenzhen, China. We specialize in comprehensive global shipping solutions for clients importing or sourcing goods from China.</p>
        <p>Our service portfolio accommodates all shipment sizes—from bulk cargo, including Full Container Load (FCL), to small parcel delivery, ranging from 0.1kg items via China Post to 18kg express shipments through DHL.</p>
        <ul class="about-features">
          <li><svg class="icon-svg fa-check-circle" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"/></svg> Freight Consolidation from multiple suppliers</li>
          <li><svg class="icon-svg fa-check-circle" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"/></svg> Third-Party Logistics (3PL) services</li>
          <li><svg class="icon-svg fa-check-circle" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"/></svg> Local warehousing, repacking &amp; labeling</li>
          <li><svg class="icon-svg fa-check-circle" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM369 209L241 337c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-64-64c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9s24.6-9.4 33.9 0l47 47L335 175c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0s9.4 24.6 0 33.9z"/></svg> Direct partnerships with major carriers</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://goodhopefreight.com/info/about-us/our-contacts.html" class="btn-hero-primary mt-3" style="display: inline-flex;"> <svg class="icon-svg fa-envelope" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M48 64C21.5 64 0 85.5 0 112c0 15.1 7.1 29.3 19.2 38.4L236.8 313.6c11.4 8.5 27 8.5 38.4 0L492.8 150.4c12.1-9.1 19.2-23.3 19.2-38.4c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48H48zM0 176V384c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64H448c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64V176L294.4 339.2c-22.8 17.1-54 17.1-76.8 0L0 176z"/></svg> Contact Our Team </a> </div>
