<!-- ===== SUCCESS STORIES ===== -->
<section class="section stories" id="stories">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header"> <span class="section-badge"><svg class="icon-svg fa-quote-right" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M448 296c0 66.3-53.7 120-120 120h-8c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32h8c30.9 0 56-25.1 56-56v-8H320c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V160c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64h64c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64v32 32 72zm-256 0c0 66.3-53.7 120-120 120H64c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32h8c30.9 0 56-25.1 56-56v-8H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V160c0-35.3 28.7-64 64-64h64c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64v32 32 72z"/></svg> SUCCESS STORIES</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Client Success Stories</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Real feedback from our valued clients around the world.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="story-card">
          <div class="quote-icon"><svg class="icon-svg fa-quote-left" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 216C0 149.7 53.7 96 120 96h8c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32h-8c-30.9 0-56 25.1-56 56v8h64c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64v64c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V320 288 216zm256 0c0-66.3 53.7-120 120-120h8c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32h-8c-30.9 0-56 25.1-56 56v8h64c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64v64c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H320c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V320 288 216z"/></svg></div>
          <p>"Five years ago, Mr. Shab from MSV Sport (UK) launched his sports apparel and accessories business. From the very beginning, he entrusted his logistics to our premium DHL, FedEx, and UPS courier services. Today, MSV Sport has successfully established a market presence across the entire European region."</p>
          <div class="story-author">
            <div class="author-avatar">MS</div>
            <div class="author-info">
              <h6>MSV SPORT</h6>
              <span>United Kingdom • Sports Apparel</span> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="story-card">
          <div class="quote-icon"><svg class="icon-svg fa-quote-left" viewBox="0 0 448 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 216C0 149.7 53.7 96 120 96h8c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32h-8c-30.9 0-56 25.1-56 56v8h64c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64v64c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H64c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V320 288 216zm256 0c0-66.3 53.7-120 120-120h8c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32s-14.3 32-32 32h-8c-30.9 0-56 25.1-56 56v8h64c35.3 0 64 28.7 64 64v64c0 35.3-28.7 64-64 64H320c-35.3 0-64-28.7-64-64V320 288 216z"/></svg></div>
          <p>"Mr. Jacky manages the lighting business from Zhongshan and Yiwu to America. After using our China air freight services shipping to the USA, their business keeps increasing year by year, and their clients give them more and more business."</p>
          <div class="story-author">
            <div class="author-avatar">AT</div>
            <div class="author-info">
              <h6>ASHOKA TRADING LIMITED</h6>
              <span>USA • Lighting Products</span> </div>
